title Vinyl: Now playing's transition at 480x320 and 320x480, their real density: Crossfade 20 sec ends the 480x320 format line ("..., crossfade 20 s", one line, no chip of its own); 320x480 shows no transition (its layout has no such chip, as with Gapless)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
# the 3.5-inch panel's 6.3 px/mm: ROW 44, the approved 480x320 layout's volume group and seek row 43 px (the owner's rule R-4)
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_TRANSITION crossfade_20

wait 1200
shot 01-now-crossfade-20
expect notext "Crossfade 20 s"
expect notext "Gapless"
expect noquit
